      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but rest doesnt really solve anything. the debt is still there, the job is still a disaster, and everyone i told about this just looks at me with that pitying face. it feels like i'm just wasting everyone's time by even existing in this state. like, there is no version of the future where this actually gets better, it's just more of the same misery forever. i just want it to stop. i just want the noise to stop.",
